  "lesson": "## Point the effect at the right channel\n\nThe FLX4 has one BEAT FX and three CH SELECT buttons. Before the first echo out, choose channel 1 because A is leaving; before the second, choose channel 2 because now B is leaving. Each choice is made in the bar before the phrase end, and the echo goes on on the last beat.\n\nEcho on the wrong channel is the classic FLX4 mistake: you press ON, cut the fader, and the tail comes from the track that is still playing. MASTER is the third choice and is rarely right for a transition, since it effects both decks. Get in the habit of touching CH SELECT as part of the move, not as setup.\n",
